<title>JAPAN: Asahi Bank posts 79.9 bln yen 96/97 appraisal loss.</title>
<headline>Asahi Bank posts 79.9 bln yen 96/97 appraisal loss.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that it had posted an appraisal loss of 79.9 billion yen on its securities holdings in the 1996/97 business year ended March 31.</p>
</text>
